*.bak

# On-device ML assets that are COPIES of files already in the tree.
# `scripts/prepare-ml-assets.mjs` regenerates both on install, on `pnpm dev` and before
# every build, so a fresh clone still works. Committing them would add ~95 MB of
# duplicated binaries to the repo history permanently.
#   public/models/ ← copy of resources/models/ (that one IS tracked — it is the master)
#   public/wasm/   ← copy of node_modules/onnxruntime-web/dist/*.wasm
/public/models/
/public/wasm/

